[{"client_msg_id":"1afa508b-9952-4d0b-9231-8f4542079f52","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"とりあえず Karabiner-Elements 完全理解しました。ありがとうございました。","ts":"1620296657.138900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iZCRf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a210e09c-d84d-4669-a50f-eb1d8b8f7864","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そうか、確かにバックアップありましたね","ts":"1620296639.138700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ujR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5d076da-a205-4249-9466-af0cb533b2da","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"別のルール追加では壊れないようでした！構成に変更があると `automatic_backups` 以下に日付レベルで以前の karabiner.json がバックアップされるようです。","ts":"1620296570.138000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cxG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38b40214-280a-4d7d-b888-ba8f96472137","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"immutableになってるかは確認してないんですが、関係ないルール追加しても壊れる可能性あるかなーって思いました","ts":"1620296199.136300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DYiNA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c9098ad-1cb6-4579-89e8-627c7395c0cf","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"再度そのルールを適用したら、そっちを変更しないと上書きされるってことですかね。なんとなく構成は理解しました。","ts":"1620296171.135700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PvVV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b39f9bd-e66c-4bb4-8f24-36bc9352e8ce","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そうですね","ts":"1620296168.135500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oAMI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e12a43ff-5517-4843-834d-b99643dc7271","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"それは assets/complex_modifications/以下のってことですか？","ts":"1620296079.135200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"alR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4c743fe-d1dd-4982-b3c3-b3eb81103e59","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"えーっと、complex_modificationsに入れたやつがGUIのルール一覧に出てきて、そこでAdd ruleした場合にkarabiner.jsonに書き込まれる、だと思います","ts":"1620295948.134800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aohXm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dc82c8a-1e8b-4c8c-a2ad-d030af403585","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"おっ？そうなのですか？ルール追加はほぼほぼしないのでだいじょうぶかもですが。正しい設定ファイルってどこになるんでしょうか？","ts":"1620295875.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vkr9O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e9bad0-fad0-4e65-9a0c-b52f6fcbf408","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U7TMPGWJ0\u003e karabiner.jsonって自動生成のやつだった気がするんですが、ルールをGUIから追加したときに壊れませんかね？","ts":"1620295756.133200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DMYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8830862-1756-4f8d-bd88-0682d204c800","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なぜか、最初、800行くらいの `assets/complex_modifications/xxxxxxxx.json` をいじり始めてしまって。。大量に設定追加したのですが期待した形にならずで。 `karabiner.json` で数カ所追加したらできました。よかったよかった","ts":"1620294831.132600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dCiv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b0c2092-e897-4ff1-a04b-16380eb1eb27","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"できました！！","ts":"1620294510.131900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FwDY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"929932b6-dd24-4262-aac7-aa89efbface0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"org.virtualbox.app.VirtualBoxVM っぽかったかも","ts":"1620294136.131400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NiEqW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3e876b3-7b40-4ed9-8afc-9c4898401fbe","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ruby かなにかでいい感じに追加したいっすね","ts":"1620293771.131100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8f6zm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b31b3567-bbcf-4dc2-a88e-f41f74e2c0d8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```{\n  \"title\": \"Terminal keybind\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Switch Option to Meta in Terminal\",\n      \"manipulators\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"basic\",\n          \"from\": {\n            \"key_code\": \"a\",\n            \"modifiers\": {\n              \"mandatory\": [\n                \"right_command\"\n              ],\n              \"optional\": [\n                \"shift\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"to\": [\n            {\n              \"key_code\": \"a\",\n              \"modifiers\": [\n                \"option\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"conditions\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"frontmost_application_if\",\n              \"bundle_identifiers\": [\n                \"^com\\\\.apple\\\\.Terminal$\"\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}```\n1つ抜き出すと自分はこんな感じです","ts":"1620293110.131000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Mu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58e46814-40a5-448f-a930-0bf7479ddaf3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"json の全体の構造把握がなんとも。ycinoさん、Hasuさん、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1620293022.130500","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1620293074.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VTV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d508e973-9ee1-4af3-b24d-1b82a3e83e66","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はちょくちょく見てますねー\nただ面倒なのは間違いないです","ts":"1620292835.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u7o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72ecef13-9746-4cc5-99a9-4424d3388deb","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、なるほど。試してみます。絶対にドキュメントを開かない強い気持ちでいるのですが、そろそろドキュメントみないとですかね","ts":"1620292816.129600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i2Nd4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51a11a4b-0fc8-4225-94a1-baead2fa4c8d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"過去のやつ見たら自分は全部に書いてました","ts":"1620292768.129200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nG/SQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7458e18-bf13-4e44-b069-b9fa002bc840","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、一気に適用できるのかな・・・","ts":"1620292731.128900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GX4o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0eb37abb-d5f9-4e87-94da-5d383a950396","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"各ルールにすべて書かないと駄目ぽな感じなのですかね？","ts":"1620292718.128600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8BW/K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56dc8766-b325-4468-92bc-1f7455c6b118","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"上の記事Karabiner-Elementsじゃなくて古いKarabinerかと思います","ts":"1620292702.128200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yf5S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce1a3a8a-c495-42c8-9fde-0cfd68ff9f28","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```\"conditions\": [\n  {\n    \"type\": \"frontmost_application_unless\",\n    \"bundle_identifiers\": [\"^org\\\\.virtualbox\\\\.app\\\\.VirtualBox$\"]\n  }\n]```\nかな？","ts":"1620292666.127600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2WHI8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20fd72dc-a3b7-4968-809b-499bfe7f75d9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"先越されてた","ts":"1620292647.127200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0op"}]},{"client_msg_id":"215ae11c-169e-43b8-9fd3-f43969ef49b7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/kazoo04/items/dca88bf882ce33be4fb5\u003e","ts":"1620292633.126700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: OSX上のVirtualBoxを使う時だけKarabinerを無効にする - Qiita","id":1,"title":"OSX上のVirtualBoxを使う時だけKarabinerを無効にする - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/kazoo04/items/dca88bf882ce33be4fb5","text":"はじめに Karabiner は OSX の様々なキーバインドを変更できる便利なアプリケーションです 私は、Macbook の英字キーボードで、右/左の Command キーを単体で押すとで「かな」/「英数」を切り替えられるよ...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3DOSX%25E4%25B8%258A%25E3%2581%25AEVirtualBox%25E3%2582%2592%25E4%25BD%25BF%25E3%2581%2586%25E6%2599%2582%25E3%2581%25A0%25E3%2581%2591Karabiner%25E3%2582%2592%25E7%2584%25A1%25E5%258A%25B9%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2582%258B%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3Da3811b526f299dd8f093c81fe341c093\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540kazoo04%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3D3555e5121fa906adb995dc5c6f823253\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=76ce1412e5d0959a9be607bd0646dbea","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/kazoo04/items/dca88bf882ce33be4fb5","original_url":"https://qiita.com/kazoo04/items/dca88bf882ce33be4f